	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et vitę innocentiam a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quod <persName ref="p1040">Udalricus Eckstein</persName> ad vos redit, charissime Heinrice, non sua culpa fit, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sed <persName ref="p6569">Sebastiano</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="1"><persName ref="p6569">Hans Sebastian (Bastian)</persName> war seit 1532 Pfarrer in <placeName ref="l1068">Murten</placeName> (<placeName ref="l2786">Kt. Freiburg</placeName>). Im Jahre 1536 wechselte er nach <placeName ref="l1471">Münsingen</placeName> (<placeName ref="l2826">Kt. Bern</placeName>). Über seine Studien und sein Leben ist sonst nichts Näheres bekannt. - Lit.: Lohner 118. 508.</note> valetudinario aliquot nunc mensibus et certe tam pecuniis quam viribus exhausto cum fratres, quos <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>vocant capitulares, qui diaconum habent, gratis succurrere velint et <persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName> a <placeName ref="l1068">Moretano</placeName> senatu impetraverit, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>non amplius ullius eget opera in verbi ministerio.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Praeterea ratio victus <persName ref="p6569">Sebastiano</persName> non est tanta, ut vel <persName ref="p1040">Udalricum</persName> vel alium quemcunque <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sufferre posset.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quare vobis eum alioqui commendatum rursum commendamus, ne apud vos illi unquam obfuturum sit, quod <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>a nobis hoc tempore amandatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Cęterum expectans expecto ad literas meas postremas<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Siehe oben <ref target="file10297">Nr. 266</ref>, S. 191-196.</note> responsionem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nihil enim iucundius mihi <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>unquam hac vita contingere potest, quam dum literis et libris te praesentem conspicio.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quam vellem mihi communicares, quae in aliquot Pauli <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>epistolas congessisti, orationis Paulinę scilicet dispositionem<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Zur rhetorischen Auslegung der paulinischen Briefe vgl. <bibl source="b282">Hausammann</bibl> 145-182; s. noch oben S. 194, Anm. 47.</note>!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Libellum tuum de ratione studii<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Siehe <bibl source="b1">HBBW I</bibl> <ref target="file10054">[Nr. 28]</ref> 177, Anm. 3. II 94, Anm. 2.</note> transcribit nunc nominis tui et reipublicae christianę <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>studiosissimus <persName ref="p761">Cristannus Danmatter</persName>, parochus in <placeName ref="l170">Gerzensee</placeName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><placeName ref="l170">Gerzensee</placeName> (<placeName ref="l2826">Kt. Bern</placeName>).</note>, qui vir sane et pius et doctus non alium in te habet animum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quam et ego.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Urgeo sępe hominem, ut ad te scribat, sed prae verecundia non audet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Hoc age, ut nunquam me vacuum sinas <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et literis et libris tuis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sentio certe profectum, dum iam senesco, quem tibi totum debeo<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Zur literarischen Unterstützung <persName ref="p1391">Hallers</persName> durch <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> s. <hi>Kirchhofer,</hi> <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> 205-210. 217; vgl. oben S. 182, 1-5 u. a.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Petiere urbem vestram quidam ex sagittariis<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Die Schützen kamen zum Gesellenschießen, das zwischen dem 18. und 21. Oktober 1533 in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> stattfand, s. Kessler, Sabbata 407, 10-21.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>me nesciente.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sunt nimirum inter eos, qui non recusabunt aliquid ad me deferre.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Veniet item ad nundinas Martinianas <pb type="edition" next="210"/><lb xml:id="p1z13"/><persName ref="p19066">Burckart</persName>, <foreign xml:lang="de">der tuͤchlitrager<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="8">Tuchhändler (<bibl source="b590">SI</bibl> XII 341f. XIV 591f).</note>,</foreign> quem et ego tibi indico.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Apud hunc enim remittam libellum<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Die «Studiorum ratio», s. oben Z. 14.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Cęterum, so ist der brieff<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Nämlich des <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Rates an <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>, 8. September 1533, s. oben <ref target="file10289">[Nr. 258]</ref> S. 182, Anm. 14.</note> von der straff <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>dess eebruchs gschriben nitt von fier, sunder von dryen tagen allein<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Zum Sachverhalts. oben <ref target="file10289">[Nr. 258]</ref> S. 182, 12-15.</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Ich han kein zwifel, wenn er gschriben <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>wäri, wie mir anzeiget heist<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief ist nicht erhalten.</note>, es hette kein not gehept.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Das schrib ich von unsert wägen, dann unglyche <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>diser zweyen stetten<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> und <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</note> thuͦt unß wee.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, mi <persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName>, ea valetudine et mentis et corporis, quam quottidie tibi a patre per Christu<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>m precor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p1753">Leonem</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note> et symmistas omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, 18. octobris anno 33.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Tuus ut suus <persName ref="p1391">B. H.</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
